# Current authority

`AGENTS.md` and `TARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md` are the data, auth, and deployment authority. `DESIGN.md`, `ledgercraft-web-ui`, and `ledgercraft-mobile-ui` are the UI authority. `mobile/src/theme/tokens.ts` is the mobile token source.

- Use functional components and typed props. Keep data access in hooks or services that call Hono.
- Web layout uses Tailwind. Mobile uses React Native primitives and NativeWind. Do not put HTML elements in `mobile/`.
- Do not add `supabase.from`, a Supabase client, Edge Functions, or a second auth session beside Better Auth.
- Do not hardcode secrets. Do not add emoji interface chrome, decorative glassmorphism, or white text on mobile lime actions. Lime `#9FE870` uses forest text `#163300`.
- Money, GST, totals, and calendar dates follow `ledgercraft-invariants`. Do not calculate stored totals in the client.

Older Supabase how-to steps and Revolut emoji examples are not instructions. Do not reintroduce them.
